{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53836","headline":"题北峰黄道士草堂 · 李绅","name":"题北峰黄道士草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清溪道士紫微仙，暗诵真经北斗前。\n坛上独窥华顶月，雾中潜到羽人天。\n飞流夜落银河水，乔木朝含绦阙烟。\n会了浮名休世事，伴君闲种五芝田。\n（按：宋林表民《天台前集别编》于杨衡《登紫霄峰赠黄仙师》诗下注：「即李绅所题北峰黄道士也。\n」杨诗收入《全唐诗》卷四六五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}